[
  {
    "start": 0.14,
    "end": 3.22,
    "text": "最强的RA计开发者正在集体倒退"
  },
  {
    "start": 3.22,
    "end": 5.86,
    "text": "大多数人以为RA就是销量数据库"
  },
  {
    "start": 5.86,
    "end": 10.5,
    "text": "但真正做出效果的人反而再回归BM25回归全文检索"
  },
  {
    "start": 10.5,
    "end": 12.94,
    "text": "这不是技术倒退,是看透了本质"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.94,
    "end": 15.9,
    "text": "大家好,这里是LLMX FACTORS"
  },
  {
    "start": 15.9,
    "end": 19.7,
    "text": "一个专注于拆解大语言模型时代底层逻辑的频道"
  },
  {
    "start": 19.7,
    "end": 24.26,
    "text": "今天我要分享的是我从技术讨论中提取出的实战经验"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.26,
    "end": 27.46,
    "text": "这些不是理论,是正在生产环境跑的真实方案"
  },
  {
    "start": 27.46,
    "end": 28.58,
    "text": "先看一组数据"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.7,
    "end": 31.26,
    "text": "我调研了开发者们实际在用什么方案"
  },
  {
    "start": 31.26,
    "end": 35.7,
    "text": "BM25和全文检索被提及42次,而且态度都是强烈推荐"
  },
  {
    "start": 35.7,
    "end": 39.54,
    "text": "混合检索31次,纯销量数据库只有28次"
  },
  {
    "start": 39.54,
    "end": 42.02,
    "text": "而且很多人是在说谨慎使用"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.02,
    "end": 44.46,
    "text": "SQLite的方案被提了23次"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.46,
    "end": 46.86,
    "text": "很多人用了Surprisingly Well这样的词"
  },
  {
    "start": 46.86,
    "end": 51.06,
    "text": "一个明显的pattern时,经验越丰富的开发者越倾向于简单方案"
  },
  {
    "start": 51.06,
    "end": 52.38,
    "text": "为什么会这样?"
  },
  {
    "start": 52.38,
    "end": 55.1,
    "text": "我们先来看销量数据库被高估的几个原因"
  },
  {
    "start": 55.1,
    "end": 56.74,
    "text": "第一,代码搜索场景"
  },
  {
    "start": 56.78,
    "end": 58.54,
    "text": "有个高赞评论说得很直接"
  },
  {
    "start": 58.54,
    "end": 60.38,
    "text": "别用销量数据库搜代码"
  },
  {
    "start": 60.38,
    "end": 62.06,
    "text": "embatings又慢又不坠"
  },
  {
    "start": 62.06,
    "end": 66.3,
    "text": "代码需要的是BM25加Tragram,效果更好,速度更快"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.3,
    "end": 67.42,
    "text": "原因很简单"
  },
  {
    "start": 67.42,
    "end": 70.7,
    "text": "代码搜索需要精确匹配含数名、变量名"
  },
  {
    "start": 70.7,
    "end": 72.62,
    "text": "而embatings天生是模糊的"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.62,
    "end": 75.06,
    "text": "第二,效率悲伦"
  },
  {
    "start": 75.06,
    "end": 78.38,
    "text": "一个生产环境的开发者分享了他们的经历"
  },
  {
    "start": 78.38,
    "end": 80.06,
    "text": "他们一开始用了cool vector"
  },
  {
    "start": 80.06,
    "end": 82.74,
    "text": "后来发现数据里有一个结构化字段"
  },
  {
    "start": 82.74,
    "end": 85.18,
    "text": "和需要检索的内容是百分之百对应的"
  },
  {
    "start": 85.26,
    "end": 87.94,
    "text": "于是他们改成了先匹配这个字段"
  },
  {
    "start": 87.94,
    "end": 89.82,
    "text": "匹配不上再用销量搜索"
  },
  {
    "start": 89.82,
    "end": 93.86,
    "text": "结果呢,85%的时候根本不需要销量搜索"
  },
  {
    "start": 93.86,
    "end": 95.62,
    "text": "所以在选技术方案之前"
  },
  {
    "start": 95.62,
    "end": 97.26,
    "text": "先问一个问题"
  },
  {
    "start": 97.26,
    "end": 99.02,
    "text": "你真的需要语异搜索吗?"
  },
  {
    "start": 99.02,
    "end": 100.9,
    "text": "第三,隐藏成本"
  },
  {
    "start": 100.9,
    "end": 103.34,
    "text": "销量数据库有很多人忽略的成本"
  },
  {
    "start": 103.34,
    "end": 104.82,
    "text": "每次内容更新都要重新跑"
  },
  {
    "start": 104.82,
    "end": 107.82,
    "text": "embatings需要GPU或大量CPU"
  },
  {
    "start": 107.82,
    "end": 110.14,
    "text": "embatings是黑盒,很难调识"
  },
  {
    "start": 110.14,
    "end": 111.38,
    "text": "基础设施也复杂"
  },
  {
    "start": 111.38,
    "end": 112.78,
    "text": "有人总结得很精皮"
  },
  {
    "start": 112.78,
    "end": 115.34,
    "text": "大多数销量数据库是拿着锤子找钉子"
  },
  {
    "start": 115.34,
    "end": 117.1,
    "text": "那真正有效的方案是什么?"
  },
  {
    "start": 117.1,
    "end": 117.98,
    "text": "方案1"
  },
  {
    "start": 117.98,
    "end": 119.62,
    "text": "sqlite 全家筒"
  },
  {
    "start": 119.62,
    "end": 122.62,
    "text": "sqlite加fts5加sqlitevec"
  },
  {
    "start": 122.62,
    "end": 124.5,
    "text": "再加本地LLM"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.5,
    "end": 125.3,
    "text": "zoorranking"
  },
  {
    "start": 125.3,
    "end": 127.34,
    "text": "为什么这个方案被推荐这么多?"
  },
  {
    "start": 127.34,
    "end": 128.98,
    "text": "零,外部依赖"
  },
  {
    "start": 128.98,
    "end": 130.42,
    "text": "好妙级响应"
  },
  {
    "start": 130.42,
    "end": 132.22,
    "text": "能处理几百万条数据"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.22,
    "end": 133.46,
    "text": "开发条是简单"
  },
  {
    "start": 133.46,
    "end": 134.38,
    "text": "很多人表示"
  },
  {
    "start": 134.38,
    "end": 136.86,
    "text": "这个方案搞定了他们95%的需求"
  },
  {
    "start": 136.86,
    "end": 137.66,
    "text": "方案2"
  },
  {
    "start": 137.66,
    "end": 139.54,
    "text": "postgres加bugvector"
  },
  {
    "start": 139.54,
    "end": 141.38,
    "text": "就是生产环境的文件选择"
  },
  {
    "start": 141.42,
    "end": 142.18,
    "text": "有人说"
  },
  {
    "start": 142.18,
    "end": 143.34,
    "text": "我们选bugvector"
  },
  {
    "start": 143.34,
    "end": 145.7,
    "text": "纯粹是因为团队已经会用postgres"
  },
  {
    "start": 145.7,
    "end": 146.94,
    "text": "运为交界也方便"
  },
  {
    "start": 146.94,
    "end": 148.9,
    "text": "这是一个很实在的理由"
  },
  {
    "start": 148.9,
    "end": 151.06,
    "text": "技术选型不是选最先进的"
  },
  {
    "start": 151.06,
    "end": 152.7,
    "text": "是选最适合团队的"
  },
  {
    "start": 152.7,
    "end": 153.78,
    "text": "方案3"
  },
  {
    "start": 153.78,
    "end": 154.78,
    "text": "混合解锁"
  },
  {
    "start": 154.78,
    "end": 156.58,
    "text": "这是当前的最佳时间工时"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.58,
    "end": 158.38,
    "text": "bm25 做关键词匹配"
  },
  {
    "start": 158.38,
    "end": 159.38,
    "text": "销量搜索"
  },
  {
    "start": 159.38,
    "end": 160.86,
    "text": "做语意相似度"
  },
  {
    "start": 160.86,
    "end": 162.98,
    "text": "最后用reranking 充牌结果"
  },
  {
    "start": 162.98,
    "end": 163.78,
    "text": "具体工具有"
  },
  {
    "start": 163.78,
    "end": 166.94,
    "text": "postgresq 加bugvector 加 parade DB"
  },
  {
    "start": 166.94,
    "end": 167.66,
    "text": "或者"
  },
  {
    "start": 167.66,
    "end": 168.78,
    "text": "mealy search"
  },
  {
    "start": 168.78,
    "end": 169.78,
    "text": "开箱即用"
  },
  {
    "start": 169.78,
    "end": 170.86,
    "text": "或者 lens DB"
  },
  {
    "start": 170.9,
    "end": 172.06,
    "text": "做嵌入式方案"
  },
  {
    "start": 172.06,
    "end": 173.3,
    "text": "这里有一个决策数"
  },
  {
    "start": 173.3,
    "end": 174.78,
    "text": "可以帮你快速选择"
  },
  {
    "start": 174.78,
    "end": 176.3,
    "text": "数据量小于1万条"
  },
  {
    "start": 176.3,
    "end": 178.62,
    "text": "sqlitefts5 就够了"
  },
  {
    "start": 178.62,
    "end": 179.74,
    "text": "一万到一百万"
  },
  {
    "start": 179.74,
    "end": 181.58,
    "text": "用sqlitevec 或 lens DB"
  },
  {
    "start": 181.58,
    "end": 182.82,
    "text": "超过一百万"
  },
  {
    "start": 182.82,
    "end": 184.94,
    "text": "再考虑postgres 加bugvector"
  },
  {
    "start": 184.94,
    "end": 185.9,
    "text": "搜的是代码"
  },
  {
    "start": 185.9,
    "end": 187.9,
    "text": "用bm25 加trigram"
  },
  {
    "start": 187.9,
    "end": 189.1,
    "text": "不要用 embedding"
  },
  {
    "start": 189.1,
    "end": 190.74,
    "text": "搜的是自然语言文档"
  },
  {
    "start": 190.74,
    "end": 191.98,
    "text": "上混合解锁"
  },
  {
    "start": 191.98,
    "end": 192.82,
    "text": "没有 GPU"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.82,
    "end": 195.1,
    "text": "用 onX Runtime 配合小模型"
  },
  {
    "start": 195.1,
    "end": 197.74,
    "text": "比如mongoDB 那个 MD BroLiver"
  },
  {
    "start": 197.74,
    "end": 199.7,
    "text": "我们再来看几个高手的具体时间"
  },
  {
    "start": 199.7,
    "end": 200.82,
    "text": "第一个案例"
  },
  {
    "start": 200.94,
    "end": 203.86,
    "text": "一个人用 MeUltra 跑个人 RAG 系统"
  },
  {
    "start": 203.86,
    "end": 207.3,
    "text": "embedding 用的是 Meta-LLMA38B"
  },
  {
    "start": 207.3,
    "end": 209.5,
    "text": "通过 MLX 跑存储"
  },
  {
    "start": 209.5,
    "end": 212.06,
    "text": "是 sqlite 的 Blob"
  },
  {
    "start": 212.06,
    "end": 213.58,
    "text": "列用囊牌存检索"
  },
  {
    "start": 213.58,
    "end": 216.34,
    "text": "用的是 FAISS CPU 版"
  },
  {
    "start": 216.34,
    "end": 217.54,
    "text": "500万个 chunks"
  },
  {
    "start": 217.54,
    "end": 219.1,
    "text": "内存占用 40GB"
  },
  {
    "start": 219.1,
    "end": 220.3,
    "text": "每天查询几次"
  },
  {
    "start": 220.3,
    "end": 221.3,
    "text": "完全够用"
  },
  {
    "start": 221.3,
    "end": 222.1,
    "text": "重点是"
  },
  {
    "start": 222.1,
    "end": 224.98,
    "text": "它从 RTX 6000 换到 MeUltra"
  },
  {
    "start": 224.98,
    "end": 226.34,
    "text": "月亮和噪音都小了"
  },
  {
    "start": 226.34,
    "end": 227.38,
    "text": "速度差不多"
  },
  {
    "start": 227.38,
    "end": 228.5,
    "text": "第二个案例"
  },
  {
    "start": 228.5,
    "end": 230.14,
    "text": "企业即可付知识库"
  },
  {
    "start": 231.14,
    "end": 233.66,
    "text": "他们用的是 embeddings 加全文解锁"
  },
  {
    "start": 233.66,
    "end": 236.26,
    "text": "加 IVF HNSW 的混合方案"
  },
  {
    "start": 236.26,
    "end": 237.34,
    "text": "关键是他们说"
  },
  {
    "start": 237.34,
    "end": 239.38,
    "text": "延迟和准确率真的很重要"
  },
  {
    "start": 239.38,
    "end": 240.82,
    "text": "这种规模才真正需要"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.82,
    "end": 242.34,
    "text": "专业的混合解锁架构"
  },
  {
    "start": 242.34,
    "end": 243.86,
    "text": "第三个案例"
  },
  {
    "start": 243.86,
    "end": 245.42,
    "text": "Markdown 文档场景"
  },
  {
    "start": 245.42,
    "end": 246.06,
    "text": "有人说"
  },
  {
    "start": 246.06,
    "end": 247.38,
    "text": "我 95% 的文档"
  },
  {
    "start": 247.38,
    "end": 248.98,
    "text": "都是小的 Markdown 文件"
  },
  {
    "start": 248.98,
    "end": 251.22,
    "text": "所以我直接用 sqlite FT-S55"
  },
  {
    "start": 251.22,
    "end": 252.74,
    "text": "搭建只花了一个小时"
  },
  {
    "start": 252.74,
    "end": 253.86,
    "text": "效果非常好"
  },
  {
    "start": 253.86,
    "end": 255.7,
    "text": "有时候最简单的就是最好的"
  },
  {
    "start": 255.7,
    "end": 258.02,
    "text": "代码 RAG 有一些专门的建议"
  },
  {
    "start": 258.1,
    "end": 260.7,
    "text": "工具选择上 RIP Grab 很受推荐"
  },
  {
    "start": 260.7,
    "end": 262.22,
    "text": "Cloud Code 内部就在用"
  },
  {
    "start": 262.22,
    "end": 264.58,
    "text": "SAMGrab 做进台分析也不错"
  },
  {
    "start": 264.58,
    "end": 266.5,
    "text": "LSP 虽然理论上很好"
  },
  {
    "start": 266.5,
    "end": 268.06,
    "text": "但目前集成还不成熟"
  },
  {
    "start": 268.06,
    "end": 269.1,
    "text": "embedding 策略上"
  },
  {
    "start": 269.1,
    "end": 272.18,
    "text": "对文件路径和函数签名做 embedding 是有效的"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.18,
    "end": 275.7,
    "text": "但代码内容本身还是用 BM25 加 TREGram"
  },
  {
    "start": 275.7,
    "end": 276.26,
    "text": "记住"
  },
  {
    "start": 276.26,
    "end": 278.5,
    "text": "不要对整个代码库做 embedding"
  },
  {
    "start": 278.5,
    "end": 279.66,
    "text": "那效果很差"
  },
  {
    "start": 279.66,
    "end": 281.14,
    "text": "这些时间告诉我们什么"
  },
  {
    "start": 281.14,
    "end": 282.42,
    "text": "对个人开发者来说"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.42,
    "end": 284.3,
    "text": "你不需要从相量数据库开始"
  },
  {
    "start": 284.3,
    "end": 285.26,
    "text": "推荐路径是"
  },
  {
    "start": 285.26,
    "end": 287.94,
    "text": "先用 sqlite FT-S55 快速验证想法"
  },
  {
    "start": 287.94,
    "end": 289.46,
    "text": "确认需要语异搜索后"
  },
  {
    "start": 289.46,
    "end": 290.9,
    "text": "再加 sqlite VAC"
  },
  {
    "start": 290.9,
    "end": 292.74,
    "text": "规模大了再考虑迁移"
  },
  {
    "start": 292.74,
    "end": 294.02,
    "text": "这样省下的时间"
  },
  {
    "start": 294.02,
    "end": 295.74,
    "text": "可以专注在业务逻辑上"
  },
  {
    "start": 295.74,
    "end": 297.18,
    "text": "对技术决策者来说"
  },
  {
    "start": 297.18,
    "end": 299.22,
    "text": "相量数据库可能是过渡工程"
  },
  {
    "start": 299.22,
    "end": 301.66,
    "text": "内部工具和代码搜索用 BM25"
  },
  {
    "start": 301.66,
    "end": 303.38,
    "text": "精确匹配更重要"
  },
  {
    "start": 303.38,
    "end": 307.22,
    "text": "小规模文档用 sqlite 0 运为成本"
  },
  {
    "start": 307.22,
    "end": 309.66,
    "text": "中规模且需要语异搜索"
  },
  {
    "start": 309.66,
    "end": 311.3,
    "text": "用 Postgres 混合方案"
  },
  {
    "start": 311.3,
    "end": 313.86,
    "text": "大规模生产环境再考虑专用相量库"
  },
  {
    "start": 313.86,
    "end": 315.3,
    "text": "但先验证必要性"
  },
  {
    "start": 315.3,
    "end": 316.82,
    "text": "更深层的认知是什么"
  },
  {
    "start": 316.86,
    "end": 318.62,
    "text": "为什么最强开发者在倒退"
  },
  {
    "start": 318.62,
    "end": 319.86,
    "text": "这不是倒退"
  },
  {
    "start": 319.86,
    "end": 321.62,
    "text": "是穿越了技术焦虑期"
  },
  {
    "start": 321.62,
    "end": 323.02,
    "text": "新手不知道用什么"
  },
  {
    "start": 323.02,
    "end": 324.22,
    "text": "选最简单的"
  },
  {
    "start": 324.22,
    "end": 325.86,
    "text": "终极知道有更好的"
  },
  {
    "start": 325.86,
    "end": 326.82,
    "text": "选最选的"
  },
  {
    "start": 326.82,
    "end": 328.18,
    "text": "高级知道什么够用"
  },
  {
    "start": 328.18,
    "end": 329.38,
    "text": "选最合适的"
  },
  {
    "start": 329.38,
    "end": 330.78,
    "text": "真正的技术判断力"
  },
  {
    "start": 330.78,
    "end": 331.82,
    "text": "是知道什么时候"
  },
  {
    "start": 331.82,
    "end": 333.38,
    "text": "不需要用复杂方案"
  },
  {
    "start": 333.38,
    "end": 334.98,
    "text": "有一个有趣的观察"
  },
  {
    "start": 334.98,
    "end": 335.7,
    "text": "有人指出"
  },
  {
    "start": 335.7,
    "end": 338.5,
    "text": "BM25, TFIDF 和 Nougrams"
  },
  {
    "start": 338.5,
    "end": 339.82,
    "text": "一直是信息检索领域"
  },
  {
    "start": 339.82,
    "end": 341.74,
    "text": "极难被打败的机械"
  },
  {
    "start": 341.74,
    "end": 342.42,
    "text": "这就是为什么"
  },
  {
    "start": 342.42,
    "end": 343.3,
    "text": "Ambedding 至今"
  },
  {
    "start": 343.3,
    "end": 344.58,
    "text": "没有带来信息检索的"
  },
  {
    "start": 344.58,
    "end": 345.7,
    "text": "Chat GPT 时刻"
  },
  {
    "start": 345.7,
    "end": 347.1,
    "text": "甚至Google 从BM25"
  },
  {
    "start": 347.1,
    "end": 348.62,
    "text": "换到Bird Embedding 后"
  },
  {
    "start": 348.62,
    "end": 349.98,
    "text": "用户体验反而变差了"
  },
  {
    "start": 349.98,
    "end": 351.58,
    "text": "信息检索和大语言模型"
  },
  {
    "start": 351.58,
    "end": 352.74,
    "text": "是不同的问题"
  },
  {
    "start": 352.74,
    "end": 353.86,
    "text": "不要混为一谈"
  },
  {
    "start": 353.86,
    "end": 354.94,
    "text": "记住这三句话"
  },
  {
    "start": 354.94,
    "end": 355.58,
    "text": "第一"
  },
  {
    "start": 355.58,
    "end": 357.5,
    "text": "代码搜索用BM25"
  },
  {
    "start": 357.5,
    "end": 358.58,
    "text": "不要用 Embedding"
  },
  {
    "start": 358.58,
    "end": 359.22,
    "text": "第二"
  },
  {
    "start": 359.22,
    "end": 360.66,
    "text": "85% 的场景"
  },
  {
    "start": 360.66,
    "end": 361.98,
    "text": "SQLite 就够了"
  },
  {
    "start": 361.98,
    "end": 362.74,
    "text": "第三"
  },
  {
    "start": 362.74,
    "end": 365.14,
    "text": "混合检索是当前最佳时间"
  },
  {
    "start": 365.14,
    "end": 365.98,
    "text": "但先验证"
  },
  {
    "start": 365.98,
    "end": 367.3,
    "text": "你是否需要混合"
  },
  {
    "start": 367.3,
    "end": 368.54,
    "text": "下一步你可以做的"
  },
  {
    "start": 368.54,
    "end": 369.62,
    "text": "如果正在选型"
  },
  {
    "start": 369.62,
    "end": 371.86,
    "text": "从SQLite FT-S5 开始"
  },
  {
    "start": 371.86,
    "end": 373.06,
    "text": "如果已有销量库"
  },
  {
    "start": 373.06,
    "end": 374.58,
    "text": "检查是否真的需要"
  },
  {
    "start": 374.62,
    "end": 376.34,
    "text": "如果在做代码 RA 级"
  },
  {
    "start": 376.34,
    "end": 379.14,
    "text": "换成BM25 加 RIPGRAP 试试"
  },
  {
    "start": 379.14,
    "end": 380.26,
    "text": "相关的工具链接"
  },
  {
    "start": 380.26,
    "end": 381.34,
    "text": "我放评论区了"
  },
  {
    "start": 381.34,
    "end": 382.26,
    "text": "大多数人高估了"
  },
  {
    "start": 382.26,
    "end": 383.82,
    "text": "香料数据库的必要性"
  },
  {
    "start": 383.82,
